WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.957
Different failures call for different solutions.

00:00:02.957 --> 00:00:09.732
Missing instructions often point to better prompting, missing or private knowledge points to rag,

00:00:09.732 --> 00:00:18.322
repeated behavior problems may justify fine-tuning, and a true capability limitation may require a stronger model.

00:00:18.322 --> 00:00:22.929
Choosing a larger model should not be the automatic first response.

00:00:23.402 --> 00:00:27.119
This is one of the most useful decision slides in the module.

00:00:27.119 --> 00:00:33.989
If the problem is missing knowledge, a larger model may still not know your private or current information;

00:00:33.989 --> 00:00:36.406
retrieval is the more direct fix.
